        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_mamba.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 0a1f5e7f-8798-4693-a23a-97a0976cf038).Image",
        "Description": "Hello again 47,\r\rthe current L&apos;Aperitif journey will take you  to Sapienza, where sunrays warm your skin &amp; the air of the sea will clean your lungs.Some targets will take their last breath - so let&apos;s get the business started and the dreaming stopped. Find your fastest route to crawl through the crowd &amp; end the bad sort of singing, the nsosy guard on the balcony needs some shush, the shopkeeper raised the prices and the sloppy sea freak needs a bath.\r\rLets get it started.\r\rCheeeers,\r\rBuuuuuurgers",
